From 02c60621fe7354c30f5a3f8affe73a4762cf0653 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jose Tejada <jose.tejada@jotego.es>
Date: Sun, 8 Jun 2025 17:11:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] fixes blank line between objects and background

---
